      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "Hi, I worked on this.\n\nChanges:\n- Made the spacing between topbar buttons consistent.\n- Made the right sidebar tabs square.\n- Reduced the left inset on the right sidebar tabs.\n- Made disabled topbar buttons easier to notice.\n\nThe text buttons are still not 1:1 squares because they have labels. The icon buttons and sidebar tab buttons are square.\n\nChecks run:\n- npm --prefix frontend run typecheck\n- npm --prefix frontend run test -- TopbarButton.test.tsx ShellTopbar.test.tsx CenterPane.test.tsx SessionInterfaceSwitch.test.tsx SessionView.test.tsx TopbarOpenEditorButton.test.tsx\n- npm --prefix packages/product-ui run typecheck\n- npm --prefix packages/product-ui run test -- SessionInspectorView.test.tsx\n\nI will open the PR next. Before and after screenshots can be added there.",
